      "id": "claim_981519210e484fd5b165b65dc7695803",
      "statement": "The repository implements a two-stage Dockerfile architecture where the builder stage compiles Caddy with all declared addons using xcaddy, and the final stage copies only the compiled binary to a minimal runtime image, ensuring the final image contains zero build tools or unnecessary dependencies.",
